currentColor; border-image: none; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\">2. 국가차원에서 실시하고 있는「재난대응 안전한국훈련」은 재난안전법을 근거로</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\">&nbsp; 실제 재난상황 발생 시 효과적으로 대응하기 위한 역량 강화 및 재난관리책임기관 간 공조ㆍ협력체계 구축을 목표로 하는</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\">&nbsp; 범국가적 종합훈련입니다.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\">3. 최근 코로나19 확산 방지를 위한 방역조치로 집합교육을 지양하여 온라인상 재난대응 안전교육자료을 안내해 드리니,&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\">&nbsp; 재난을 예방하고 대비에 참고하시기 바랍니다.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\">4. 아울러, 우리학교 홈페이지에서도 '재난대비' 자료를 확인할수 있으니, 참고하시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; border: 0px currentColor; border-image: none; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-color: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial;\"><b><span